{
  "labels": [
    [
      [
        "aria-label",
        "Wallet recovery guidance",
      ],
    ],
  ],
  "meta": [],
  "text": "Wallet recoveryThe device security credential is unavailable. Close and reopen the browser, then try again. Your existing wallet data has been kept.Before removing any wallet data, verify that you have a recovery phrase or an independently usable exported backup for every wallet, including wallets saved under earlier network profiles. A copy of device-encrypted data alone cannot recover a wallet when its device credential is lost. Keep all wallet data if any recovery backup is missing.If retrying still fails, use a separate browser profile to import a recovery phrase or independently usable exported backup. Keep this browser profile and its wallet data until every wallet is recovered.",
  "title": "Import Account | MyQRLWallet",
}
`;

