  "text": "Enter Your Wallet PINEnter your existing PIN to add this wallet. All wallets use the same PIN for security.Your existing wallet PINThe device security credential is unavailable. Review the recovery steps below.Wallet recoveryThe device security credential is unavailable. Close and reopen the browser, then try again. Your existing wallet data has been kept.Before removing any wallet data, verify that you have a recovery phrase or an independently usable exported backup for every wallet, including wallets saved under earlier network profiles. A copy of device-encrypted data alone cannot recover a wallet when its device credential is lost. Keep all wallet data if any recovery backup is missing.If retrying still fails, use a separate browser profile to import a recovery phrase or independently usable exported backup. Keep this browser profile and its wallet data until every wallet is recovered.Import Wallet",
  "title": "Import Account | MyQRLWallet",
}
`;

